  "details": "In previous versions, it was possible to remove touch controls from the VRCHAT bindings so that touch judgments would not affect gestures.\n\nSince this update, it is no longer possible to remove touch judgments by doing this, so I believe this feature can be added to the settings to disable it as before.\n\nThe touch sensor of the controller is very fragile, and it is not very practical to provide new ones one after another just because this one breaks. Adding this feature would make it possible to pass over the breakdowns with a simple operation.",
